{"id":"68012bc8b343417a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Standard Parameter","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter — ZFC Ordinal8 Standard Parameter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter — ZFC Ordinal8 Standard Parameter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter — ZFC Ordinal8 Standard Parameter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3dad3d3806b81f88\" href=\"?note=3dad3d3806b81f88\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,p,n \\in V\">\\(M,p,n \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3dad3d3806b81f88\" href=\"?note=3dad3d3806b81f88\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是规范细结构标准参数谓词的别名；上游定义包含模型类型、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>、projectum、hull 生成性以及规范序下的最小性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dad3d3806b81f88","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md","status":"resolved","id":"3dad3d3806b81f88","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,p,n \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8StandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)","display":true},{"tex":"n>0","display":false}],"bytes":984,"backlinks":[{"id":"df78b73a12becb80","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"67304db766f65ebb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3021","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-standard-parameter]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3dad3d3806b81f88"]}